OL,3,Vupppppp5CTuesday
OL,5,G0000 999: Emergency Call Out
OL,6,     FA paramedic and officer pair
OL,7,     Frespond to two calls, one about a
OL,8,     Fcar crash and another about an
OL,9,     Fincreasingly dangerous argument.
OL,10,G0105 Call the Bailiffs: Time to Pay Up!
OL,11,     FMark and Sam track down a
OL,12,     Fbuilder's merchant, which seems to
OL,13,     Fbe located on a working farm with
OL,14,     Fdonkeys and ostriches, before
OL,15,     Fchasing two unusual debtors -
OL,16,     Finternational airlines.
OL,17,G0205 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,18,     FWith the computer system down, the
OL,19,     Fstaff resort to a whiteboard to
OL,20,     Fkeep track of everyone. Patients
OL,21,     Finclude two elderly men with
OL,22,     Fbreathing difficulties.
